WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.497
Right lads, Tim here.

2
00:00:01.497 --> 00:00:04.206
Two minutes on the new Touchline app.

3
00:00:04.706 --> 00:00:05.758
What it's for.

4
00:00:05.758 --> 00:00:07.413
This is our team app.

5
00:00:07.413 --> 00:00:12.751
Games, training, who's coming, where to be and when, all in one place.

6
00:00:13.251 --> 00:00:14.660
What you can use it for.

7
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.006
Say if you can make training or a game.

8
00:00:17.006 --> 00:00:18.942
Check where it is and what time.

9
00:00:18.942 --> 00:00:21.289
Look at the session before you turn up.

10
00:00:21.289 --> 00:00:26.452
And if you want to get better on your own, My own training has home sessions and clips.

11
00:00:26.452 --> 00:00:28.799
Want help with shooting or first touch?

12
00:00:28.799 --> 00:00:31.380
Hit ask for training and I'll send you one.

13
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:32.700
What I'll do.

14
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.229
I'll put the week's session up, the team and the times.

15
00:00:36.229 --> 00:00:37.993
I'll answer your questions.

16
00:00:38.493 --> 00:00:38.999
Training.

17
00:00:38.999 --> 00:00:41.526
Have a look at the session before Wednesday.

18
00:00:41.526 --> 00:00:47.087
See what we're working on and why, so we're not wasting twenty minutes explaining it on the pitch.

19
00:00:47.587 --> 00:00:48.292
Match day.

20
00:00:48.292 --> 00:00:51.533
Say yes or no early, not on Saturday morning.

21
00:00:51.533 --> 00:00:53.929
Be there at the time on the card.

22
00:00:53.929 --> 00:00:56.255
Know your job before you arrive.

23
00:00:56.255 --> 00:00:58.228
Boots, shin pads and water.

24
00:00:58.228 --> 00:00:59.214
Running late?

25
00:00:59.214 --> 00:01:02.033
There's a red help button on match day.

26
00:01:02.533 --> 00:01:03.372
Your profile.

27
00:01:03.372 --> 00:01:05.697
Tap Make it yours on the home page.

28
00:01:05.697 --> 00:01:08.602
Pick your own nickname and keep it sensible.

29
00:01:08.602 --> 00:01:10.216
Pick your stronger foot.

30
00:01:10.216 --> 00:01:12.024
Pick up to three positions.

31
00:01:12.024 --> 00:01:14.284
Three is the most, so choose well.

32
00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:16.221
Then score yourself honestly.

33
00:01:16.221 --> 00:01:20.740
It's your own view, not a mark from us, and only me and Deano see it.

34
00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:22.635
Where to get help.

35
00:01:22.635 --> 00:01:25.502
Every page has a how this works box.

36
00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:26.820
Read that first.

37
00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:27.827
Still stuck?

38
00:01:27.827 --> 00:01:30.617
Tap Ask a question and I'll answer.

39
00:01:30.617 --> 00:01:33.949
For anything serious, talk to me or Deano.

40
00:01:33.949 --> 00:01:35.964
Childline's on 0800 1111.

41
00:01:35.964 --> 00:01:37.436
See you Wednesday.

